Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The native mobile module (io.testfly.mobile) ports logic from Mobilewright's
@mobilewright/core query engine: the role-to-native-class table
(io.testfly.mobile.MobileRole) and the locator matching rules
(io.testfly.mobile.internal.LocatorEngine). The mobilecli method names and
parameters used by io.testfly.mobile.internal.MobileCliDriver follow
@mobilewright/driver-mobilecli. The API names are inspired by Mobilewright.

